  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>The <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/cordova-plugin-ms-azure-mobile-apps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Azure Mobile Apps SDK for Apache Cordova</u></a> is now at v2.0.0-RC1. This version includes better handling of conflicts for offline sync, plus&nbsp;bug fixes.&nbsp;For more details on offline sync in Apache Cordova, see the <a href=\"https://blogs.msdn.microsoft.com/appserviceteam/2016/06/29/offline-sync-with-azure-mobile-apps-and-apache-cordova/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>App Service team blog</u></a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "The Azure Mobile Apps SDK for Apache Cordova is now at v2.0.0-RC1. This version includes better handling of conflicts for offline sync, plus bug fixes. For more details on offline sync in Apache Cordova, see the App Service team blog ."
  },
